# The Legacy Collection not found: by its Chinese name (洛克人EXE 合集), and how to drag its folder onto the
# window from Steam (Steam's own menu words, as its Simplified Chinese client has them: 管理 → 浏览本地文件); the
# button opens the system's folder dialog, to choose the folder it is installed in.
msgid "nettai needs Battle Network Legacy Collection Vol. 2. Install it from Steam, then right-click it in your library, choose Manage > Browse local files, and drag the exe folder onto this window."
msgstr "nettai 需要《洛克人EXE 合集 Vol.2》。请从 Steam 安装，然后在库中右键点击它，选择「管理」→「浏览本地文件」，并将 exe 文件夹拖到此窗口。"
msgid "nettai needs Battle Network Legacy Collection Vol. 2"
msgstr "nettai 需要《洛克人EXE 合集 Vol.2》"
msgid "Install it from Steam, then right-click it in your library, choose Manage > Browse local files, and drag the exe folder onto this window."
msgstr "请从 Steam 安装，然后在库中右键点击它，选择「管理」→「浏览本地文件」，并将 exe 文件夹拖到此窗口。"
# The same in a browser (nettai-web), which has no Steam to install it from.
msgid "nettai needs Battle Network Legacy Collection Vol. 2. In Steam, right-click it in your library, choose Manage > Browse local files, and drag the exe folder onto this page."
msgstr "nettai 需要《洛克人EXE 合集 Vol.2》。请在 Steam 库中右键点击它，选择「管理」→「浏览本地文件」，并将 exe 文件夹拖到此页面。"
msgid "In Steam, right-click it in your library, choose Manage > Browse local files, and drag the exe folder onto this page."
msgstr "请在 Steam 库中右键点击它，选择「管理」→「浏览本地文件」，并将 exe 文件夹拖到此页面。"
# The same on a phone (iOS, Android), which has no Steam and takes nothing dragged onto it: the exe folder copied
# to it from a computer, then chosen.
msgid "nettai needs Battle Network Legacy Collection Vol. 2. On a computer, right-click it in your Steam library, choose Manage > Browse local files, and copy the exe folder to this device. Then choose that folder here."
msgstr "nettai 需要《洛克人EXE 合集 Vol.2》。请在电脑上的 Steam 库中右键点击它，选择「管理」→「浏览本地文件」，将 exe 文件夹复制到此设备，然后在这里选择该文件夹。"
msgid "On a computer, right-click it in your Steam library, choose Manage > Browse local files, and copy the exe folder to this device. Then choose that folder here."
msgstr "请在电脑上的 Steam 库中右键点击它，选择「管理」→「浏览本地文件」，将 exe 文件夹复制到此设备，然后在这里选择该文件夹。"
msgid "Choose folder"
msgstr "选择文件夹"
# The Legacy Collection found lacks some of a game's ROMs: {} is the game, as the header
# shows it; by its Chinese name, and Steam's own name for checking a game's files (验证游戏文件的完整性); the button opens the folder dialog again.
msgid "The Legacy Collection's files are incomplete: some of {}'s are missing. Have Steam verify the collection's files, then choose its folder again."
msgstr "《洛克人EXE 合集》的文件不完整：{}的部分文件缺失。请让 Steam 验证游戏文件的完整性，然后重新选择其文件夹。"
msgid "The Legacy Collection's files are incomplete"
msgstr "《洛克人EXE 合集》的文件不完整"
msgid "Some of {}'s files are missing. Have Steam verify the collection's files, then choose its folder again."
msgstr "{}的部分文件缺失。请让 Steam 验证游戏文件的完整性，然后重新选择其文件夹。"
# A game's content couldn't be downloaded: {} is the game, as the header shows it (the first: no game named,
# none could be).
msgid "The games' content couldn't be downloaded. Check your connection, then start nettai again."
msgstr "无法下载游戏内容。请检查网络连接，然后重新启动 nettai。"
msgid "{}'s content couldn't be downloaded. Check your connection, then start nettai again."
msgstr "无法下载{}的内容。请检查网络连接，然后重新启动 nettai。"
msgid "{}'s content couldn't be downloaded"
msgstr "无法下载{}的内容"
msgid "Check your connection, then start nettai again."
msgstr "请检查网络连接，然后重新启动 nettai。"
